# Monorepo root ignore for tripblogger_api + tripblogger_app

# Dependencies
**/node_modules/

# Environment files (keep examples)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Logs
**/logs/
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/pnpm-debug.log*

# Build outputs
**/dist/
**/build/
**/coverage/
**/.turbo/
**/.cache/
**/.eslintcache

# TypeScript
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Expo / React Native
**/.expo/
**/.expo-shared/
**/web-build/
**/.metro-health-check*
**/android/
**/ios/

# OS / Editor
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/

# Runtime / temp files
**/tmp/
**/temp/
**/*.tmp
